        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every relocation comes with IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering 100% declared value of your goods. The policy protects against loss, theft, or damage during the entire highway journey. Customers can also opt for higher coverage limits or additional rider policies for valuable items such as antiques, electronics, or religious artifacts.</p>
