        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What packing materials are used for long‑haul moves like Hazaribagh to Vadodara?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We employ a seven‑layer shock‑absorbent system: 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard sheets, stretch film for weatherproofing, and custom wooden crates for fragile items such as glassware, temple idols, and electronics. This multi‑layer approach is specifically designed for the rigors of the Hazaribagh‑Vadodara highway corridor.</p>
