      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure vehicle safety during transport on the Hazaribagh‑Vadodara route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our dedicated two‑wheeler carriers feature hydraulic loading ramps, wheel chocks, and high‑tensile ratchet lashings. Multi‑car trailers are enclosed and equipped with anti‑theft locks. Each vehicle is inspected before loading, securely anchored, and continuously monitored via GPS, guaranteeing safe transit across the 1,637‑km stretch.</p>
